msgid "Start face scan"
msgstr "Mulai pemindaian wajah"

#: src/onboarding.py:559 src/onboarding.py:613
msgid "Scan face model"
msgstr "Pindai model wajah"

#: src/onboarding.py:563
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Tidak dapat menyimpan model wajah"

#: src/onboarding.py:568 src/onboarding.py:624
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Pindai model kedua"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Tidak dapat merekam model kedua"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. Make sure your"
" face is well lit and centred, then try again -- or skip and add a mod"
"el later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Model pertama Anda sudah tersimpan, jadi masuk dengan wajah sudah berf"
"ungsi. Pastikan wajah Anda cukup terang dan berada di tengah, lalu cob"
"a lagi — atau lewati dan tambahkan model nanti dari Pengaturan."

#: src/onboarding.py:607
msgid "Add a face model (required)"
msgstr "Tambahkan model wajah (wajib)"

#: src/onboarding.py:609
msgid ""
"Face login needs at least one face model, so this scan can't be skippe"
"d. Record it in the light you usually sit in. Lighting changes how you"
"r face looks to the camera, so consider adding a second model later fr"
"om Settings, recorded in different light (for example evening lamps in"
"stead of daylight)."
msgstr ""
"Masuk dengan wajah memerlukan setidaknya satu model wajah, jadi pemind"
"aian ini tidak dapat dilewati. Rekam dalam pencahayaan tempat Anda bia"
"sa duduk. Pencahayaan mengubah cara kamera melihat wajah Anda, jadi pe"
"rtimbangkan untuk menambahkan model kedua nanti dari Pengaturan yang d"
"irekam dalam cahaya berbeda (misalnya lampu di malam hari alih-alih ca"
"haya siang)."

#: src/onboarding.py:618
msgid "Add a second face model (recommended)"
msgstr "Tambahkan model wajah kedua (disarankan)"

#: src/onboarding.py:620
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved. Lighting changes how your face looks to the"
" camera: a model recorded in daylight can fail in the evening under la"
"mps (or the other way round), and Ubuntu Hello then times out instead "
"of unlocking. A second model recorded in different light keeps recogni"
"tion reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Model pertama Anda sudah tersimpan. Pencahayaan mengubah cara kamera m"
"elihat wajah Anda: model yang direkam dalam cahaya siang bisa gagal di"
" malam hari di bawah lampu (atau sebaliknya), dan Ubuntu Hello lalu ke"
"habisan waktu alih-alih membuka kunci. Model kedua yang direkam dalam "
"cahaya berbeda menjaga pengenalan tetap andal kapan pun."

#: src/onboarding.py:622
msgid ""
"Change the lighting first: switch the room light or desk lamp on or of"
"f, turn away from the window, or put on the glasses you sometimes wear"
". Then look straight into the camera and press Scan."
msgstr ""
"Ubah pencahayaan terlebih dahulu: nyalakan atau matikan lampu ruangan "
"atau lampu meja, berpalinglah dari jendela, atau kenakan kacamata yang"
" kadang Anda pakai. Lalu tatap kamera secara langsung dan tekan Pindai"
"."

#: src/onboarding.py:660
msgid "Ubuntu Hello Setup"
msgstr "Penyiapan Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/onboarding.py:673
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware a"
"nd tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dapat secara otomatis membuka kunci {} Anda menggunakan o"
"tentikasi wajah (dompet terdeteksi: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> Memerik"
"sa perangkat keras dan alat TPM..."

#: src/onboarding.py:693
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. "
"Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dapat secara otomatis membuka kunci {} Anda menggunakan o"
"tentikasi wajah (dompet terdeteksi: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> Perangk"
"at keras TPM terdeteksi. Menginstal <i>tpm2-tools</i> secara otomatis."
".."

#: src/onboarding.py:705
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dapat secara otomatis membuka kunci {} Anda menggunakan o"
"tentikasi wajah (dompet terdeteksi: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> TPM 2.0"
" perangkat keras aktif. Kata sandi Anda akan tersegel dengan aman di d"
"alam TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dapat secara otomatis membuka kunci {} Anda menggunakan o"
"tentikasi wajah (dompet terdeteksi: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> Perangk"
"at keras TPM terdeteksi, tetapi pemasangan otomatis <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"gagal. Jalankan <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Kembali ke c"
"ache kredensial berbasis perangkat lunak."

#: src/onboarding.py:709
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dapat secara otomatis membuka kunci {} Anda menggunakan o"
"tentikasi wajah (dompet terdeteksi: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> Tidak a"
"da perangkat keras TPM yang terdeteksi. Menggunakan cache kredensial b"
"erbasis perangkat lunak (AES-256-GCM)."

