#: src/onboarding.glade:62
msgid "Setup is done!"
msgstr "Penyiapan selesai!"

#: src/onboarding.glade:81
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing any"
"thing you would normally have to type your password for to authenticat"
"e, like running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unloc"
"k, your login keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically o"
"n login.\n\nYou can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to cha"
"nge more advanced settings or add additional models. Press Finish belo"
"w to close this window and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Kita sudah selesai! Ubuntu Hello sekarang aktif di komputer ini. Coba "
"lakukan apa pun yang biasanya Anda perlukan untuk mengetikkan kata san"
"di untuk mengautentikasi, seperti menjalankan perintah dengan sudo. Ji"
"ka Anda mengaktifkan buka kunci otomatis keyring, keyring login Anda a"
"tau KWallet juga akan terbuka secara otomatis saat login.\n\nAnda dapa"
"t membuka Ubuntu Hello Configurator nanti untuk mengubah pengaturan le"
"bih lanjut atau menambahkan model tambahan. Tekan Selesai di bawah unt"
"uk menutup jendela ini dan membuka Ubuntu Hello Configurator."

#: src/onboarding.glade:129
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet us"
"ing face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello dapat secara otomatis membuka kunci kunci masuk Anda atau"
" KWallet menggunakan otentikasi wajah, mencegah permintaan kata sandi "
"setelah masuk."

#: src/onboarding.glade:141
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "Aktifkan gantungan kunci otomatis/pembukaan kunci KWallet"

#: src/onboarding.glade:183
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Konfirmasikan kata sandi"

#: src/onboarding.glade:215
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Menetapkan kebijakan kepastian"

#: src/onboarding.glade:234
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match"
" is never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you "
"can set how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Karena perubahan sudut, jarak, dan faktor lainnya, kecocokan wajah tid"
"ak pernah sama persis dengan model wajah yang disimpan. Di halaman ini"
" Anda dapat mengatur seberapa ketat Ubuntu Hello seharusnya."

#: src/onboarding.glade:273
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Cepat"

#: src/onboarding.glade:289
msgid ""
"Allows more fuzzy matches, \nbut speeds up the scanning process greatl"
"y."
msgstr ""
"Memungkinkan lebih banyak kecocokan yang tidak jelas, \ntetapi sangat "
"mempercepat proses pemindaian."

#: src/onboarding.glade:328
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Seimbang"

#: src/onboarding.glade:344
msgid ""
"Still relatively quick detection, \nbut might not log you in when furt"
"her away."
msgstr ""
"Deteksi masih relatif cepat, \ntapi mungkin tidak akan memasukkan Anda"
" saat berada jauh."

#: src/onboarding.glade:383
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Aman"

#: src/onboarding.glade:399
msgid ""
"The slightly safer option, \nbut will take much longer to authenticate"
" you"
msgstr ""
"Pilihan yang sedikit lebih aman, \nnamun akan memakan waktu lebih lama"
" untuk mengautentikasi Anda"

#: src/onboarding.glade:442
msgid "Adding a face model"
msgstr "Menambahkan model wajah"

#: src/onboarding.glade:461
msgid ""
"To authenticate you Ubuntu Hello needs to save a model of your face to"
" recognise you. Press the Scan button below to start the facial scan."
msgstr ""
"Untuk mengautentikasi Anda Ubuntu Hello perlu menyimpan model wajah An"
"da agar dapat mengenali Anda. Tekan tombol Pindai di bawah untuk memul"
"ai pemindaian wajah."

#: src/onboarding.glade:538
msgid "Skip for now"
msgstr "Lewati untuk saat ini"

#: src/onboarding.glade:544
msgid ""
"You can add more face models later from Settings or with: sudo ubuntu-"
"hello add"
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat menambahkan model wajah lain nanti dari Pengaturan atau den"
"gan: sudo ubuntu-hello add"

#: src/onboarding.glade:577 src/onboarding.glade:668
msgid "Configuring webcam"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi kamera web"

#: src/onboarding.glade:594
msgid "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?"
msgstr "Apakah pemancar inframerah berkedip?"

#: src/onboarding.glade:612
msgid "yes"
msgstr "Ya"

#: src/onboarding.glade:629
msgid "no"
msgstr "TIDAK"

#: src/onboarding.glade:687
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available c"
"ameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list "
"of usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and clic"
"k Next."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello akan mencari kamera apa pun yang tersedia di sistem Anda "
"secara otomatis, jadi pastikan webcam Anda terhubung. Setelah terdetek"
"si, daftar webcam yang dapat digunakan akan ditampilkan. Pilih salah s"
"atu yang ingin Anda gunakan dan klik Berikutnya."

#: src/onboarding.glade:709
msgid "Testing your webcams, please wait..."
msgstr "Sedang menguji webcam Anda, harap tunggu..."

#: src/onboarding.glade:761
msgid "Downloading data files"
msgstr "Mengunduh file data"

#: src/onboarding.glade:780
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello needs three pre trained facial recognition datasets to be"
" able to recognise you, which will be downloaded now. You can see the "
"download progress below."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello memerlukan tiga kumpulan data pengenalan wajah terlatih u"
"ntuk dapat mengenali Anda, yang akan diunduh sekarang. Anda dapat meli"
"hat kemajuan pengunduhan di bawah ini."

#: src/onboarding.glade:801
msgid "Starting download..."
msgstr "Mulai mengunduh..."

#: src/onboarding.glade:850
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello!"
msgstr "Selamat datang di Ubuntu Hello!"

#: src/onboarding.glade:866
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Versi"

#: src/onboarding.glade:887
msgid ""
"This wizard will walk you through the setup process and automatically "
"configure Ubuntu Hello for you. Press next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Wizard ini akan memandu Anda melalui proses pengaturan dan secara otom"
"atis mengonfigurasi Ubuntu Hello untuk Anda. Tekan berikutnya untuk me"
"lanjutkan."

#: src/onboarding.glade:911
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Membatalkan"

#: src/onboarding.glade:931
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Berikutnya"

#: src/onboarding.glade:956
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "Selesaikan penyiapan"

